  "prototypeNotes": [
    "Character creation is represented as a staged, persistent, resumable workflow.",
    "Draft validity and completed Character validity are separate concepts.",
    "Classification changes require previewed dependency recalculation.",
    "Base allocations occur before freebie spending.",
    "The freebie budget is 15 and uses source-derived candidate costs.",
    "Gift execution, rank advancement, resource spending, combat, and full Dice resolution remain outside this profile.",
    "Chronicle Core executes the generic workflow but remains unaware of Werewolf-specific stage content."
